You are tasked with implementing a custom data model class in Python for a graphical user interface (GUI) application. The data model should support adding and removing rows of data. The provided code snippet shows a partial implementation of the data model class, with some methods and comments. Your task is to complete the implementation of the data model class by adding the missing methods and ensuring that the model behaves correctly when rows are added or removed.

Your data model class should adhere to the following requirements:
